  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nIf you control no monsters, or only Pendulum
    Monsters, apply this effect, based on this card's Pendulum Zone.\r\n\u25CF Left:
    Reduce its Pendulum Scale by 3.\r\n\u25CF Right: Increase its Pendulum Scale
    by 4.\r\nDuring your opponent's Standby Phase: You can Special Summon this card.\n\n[
    Monster Effect ] \nIf this card is Special Summoned to a zone that is not the
    center Main Monster Zone, destroy it. Cannot be destroyed by battle. Once per
    turn, during your opponent's End Phase: You can target 1 card in your Pendulum
    Zone; destroy it, and if you do, place this card in your Pendulum Zone."
